  "$id": "urn:homeground:route-reality:v3:draft-outcome",
  "title": "Homeground Route Reality v3 internal draft outcome",
  "description": "A deliberately non-numeric internal outcome contract. With no approved PolicyPack, valid requests stop at policy_pending and invalid requests stop at invalid. This schema authorizes no engine, API, page or indexable surface.",
